AUTO-SELECT FIRST ROW
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

On mount or when allNodes changes:
  Auto-select the first hop-1 node 
  (highest incomingCount) so the right 
  column is never empty on first load.

  setSelectedHop1(hop1Nodes[0]?.name ?? null)

